  "contract_reason": "IPRA-off retains standard call-preserved VGPRs: ordinary v40/v41 plus lane-save v42; volatile v40/v41/v42 plus lane-save v43. Low save slots occupy offsets0/4[/8], moving array origin to16 and lane-save spill from128 to144; 16-byte frame rounding changes middle144 to160. Root local144 and leaf0 are unchanged.",
